	(text "SPI mode on SPI1. CMD = MOSI, DAT0 = MISO, DAT3 = CS. DAT1 and DAT2 pulled up, unused in SPI mode.\nR60 lets you unpower the card for debug. Same 3.3 V domain as the MCU, so no level shifter.\nU7/U8 provide ESD protection at the socket on all four SPI lines.\nR66 damps SCK. Detect switch: open with no card, closed with a card, so SD_CD reads low when a card is present (Hirose DM3 datasheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
